只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Windows-native capability pack for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): clipboard, notifications, hosts file, network diagnostics and more — safe PowerShell-backed tools for Windows users.","id":"gh:1351276292","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-win-toolkit","slug":"Edge-Echo/dsh-win-toolkit","topics":["clipboard","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","native-tools","notification","powershell","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Windows-native capability pack for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): clipboard, notifications, hosts file, net"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"work diagnostics and more — safe PowerShell-backed tools for Windows users."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-win-toolkit"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Let your agent use Windows itself: read the clipboard, raise a notification, inspect the hosts fil"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"e, test whether a port is open.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"### When you need this"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- You copied something and want the agent to read it directly, instead of pasting it into the chat\n-"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" A long task finishes while you are in another window and you want a desktop notification\n- GitHub i"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"s unreachable and you want the agent to diagnose it rather than guess"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Every value crosses the PowerShell boundary as Base64, so clipboard contents and hostnames cannot in"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ject a command. `doctor` checks the environment before you run into a missing piece."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Gives your dsh agent real Windows superpowers — clipboard, system notifications, hosts file inspecti"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"on, and network diagnostics — backed by safe, parameterized PowerShell. No extra installs, no admin "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"rights required for the current toolset."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> 中文文档见 README.zh.md。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Feedback"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Installs are visible in the download counts; whether this helps is not. If you use it, one line\nabou"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"t the actual task is worth more than a star — **particularly if it did not work**, which is\nthe case"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" that never gets reported:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- what you were trying to do\n- whether it did it\n- what was missing or wrong"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Tell me in an issue — or if something is already broken,\njust open a normal bug report."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Check your environment first"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"It verifies the platform, PowerShell, execution policy, clipboard access, WScript.Shell COM and host"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"s readability — everything the tools rely on."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| OS | **Windows 10 or 11** — the tools call `powershell.exe` |\n| PowerShell | **5.1+** (the default"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" on Windows 10/11); PowerShell 7 works as well but is not required |\n| Privileges | none for the cur"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"rent tools — everything is read-only except clipboard write and the notification popup |\n| Node | 22"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"+ (for the plugin host) |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Run `dsh-win-toolkit doctor` to verify all of the above on your machine before blaming the plugin."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Tool | What it does |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `win_clipboard_read` | Read the current clipboard text |\n| `win_clipboard_write` | Write text to t"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"he clipboard |\n| `win_notify` | Show a system popup notification (auto-closes) |\n| `win_hosts_list` "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"| Read the Windows hosts file |\n| `win_netdiag` | DNS resolution + TCP port test for any host |\n| `w"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"in_window_list` | List visible windows: title, process, PID |\n| `win_window_focus` | Bring a window "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"to the front by title substring |\n| `win_screenshot` | Capture the screen to a PNG and return its pa"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"th and size |\n| `win_process_list` | Top processes by memory, optionally filtered by name |\n| `win_o"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"pen` | Open a file, folder or URL with the default application |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Then just ask your agent, e.g.:\n- \"check if github.com:443 is reachable\" → `win_netdiag`\n- \"put this"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" text on my clipboard\" → `win_clipboard_write`\n- \"notify me when you're done\" → `win_notify`"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Every tool runs a short PowerShell snippet through `powershell.exe -NoProfile -NonInteractive`. All "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"user input crosses the script boundary as **Base64** — never string-interpolated — so argument injec"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"tion is structurally impossible."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- Config: `psTimeoutMs` (default 20000) — per-call PowerShell timeout, settable in your profile's `c"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ordis.patch.yml` under the `win-toolkit` entry.\n- Windows-only: tools fail loudly with a clear error"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" on non-Windows platforms (the entry itself is a no-op there)."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- `win_hosts_edit` (admin-gated hosts entries), `win_env`, `win_service`, `win_window`, `win_task`, "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"`win_netdiag` deep mode (proxy check, DNS server, traceroute)."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Tools fail with \"PowerShell failed\": usually an anti-virus or execution-policy quirk — the plugin "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"uses `-NoProfile -NonInteractive` but policy still applies. Check `Get-ExecutionPolicy`; the plugin "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"does not require RemoteSigned.\n- Want to see exactly what runs? The PowerShell snippets are short an"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"d readable in `src/index.ts`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- npm: <https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-win-toolkit>\n- GitHub: <https://github.com/Edge-Echo/dsh-w"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"in-toolkit>\n- License: MIT"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Related"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Part of the **dsh-toolkit family** — small, independently useful pieces for\nDeepSeek Harness:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- dsh-mcp-bridge — install six curated MCP servers, verified in CI\n- dsh-win-toolkit — clipboard, no"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"tifications, hosts, port checks on Windows\n- dsh-netassist — network and proxy diagnosis with a conc"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"rete next step\n- dsh-driftwatch — behaviour-drift reports between two session logs\n- dsh-ledger — wh"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"at the agent did to your files, provably unaltered\n- dsh-release-evidence — one verifiable artifact "},{"id":"p36s5","text":"per release\n- mcp-netassist — the same network checks as an MCP server, any client"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
